| I           | insert beginning of line     |                             |
| A           | append at end of line        |                             |
| 5j          | 5 spaces down                |                             |
| h,j,k,l     | arrow keys                   |                             |
| u           | undo                         |                             |
| C-r         | redo                         |                             |
| y           | yank                         |                             |
| p           | past bellow                  |                             |
| P           | past above                   |                             |
| d           | delete                       |                             |
| dd          | delete line                  |                             |
| yy          | yank whole line              |                             |
| c           | change                       |                             |
| cc          | change line                  |                             |
| r           | replace char                 |                             |
| w           | word                         |                             |
| b           | back                         |                             |
